' Question: which thread runs what for the bots, and what happens on a second copy of the app?
' Explained by: ../07-deployment.md. Drawn by hand, high level.
@startuml 07-threads
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
left to right direction
[bus thread\n(trading, market_data events)] as BUS
[BotEventRouter\n(copies and queues)] as RT
[worker per bot\nThreadBotWorkQueue] as W
[bots-ticker\nThreadBotTicker] as TK
[retry scheduler\n(watches' heartbeat)] as SC
[state/bots/<id>.json] as F
BUS --> RT
RT --> W : post
TK --> W : post periodic checks
SC --> W : post retries, reconciles
W --> F : the only writer
@enduml
